">✓</span>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-text\">Age-based pathways</div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-detail\">Personalised guidance for your baby's stage</div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"check-icon\">✓</span>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-text\">Tools for naps, nights, regressions, routines, and travel</div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-detail\">Everything you need, all in one place</div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"check-icon\">✓</span>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-text\">Member perks and ongoing content drops</div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-detail\">New resources added monthly</div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    <!-- Mobile scroll to checkout button -->\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"mobile-scroll-to-checkout scroll-to-checkout\">Continue to Checkout</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Why Join Section -->\n  <div class=\"why-join\">\n    <h2>Why parents join</h2>\n    <p>Fast clarity. Practical steps. A village that understands the season you're in.</p>\n    <p>Your membership provides one place for guidance, live sessions, and ongoing support so you can make steady progress and rest easier.</p>\n    <!-- Mobile scroll to checkout button -->\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"mobile-scroll-to-checkout scroll-to-checkout\">Continue to Checkout</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Footer Note -->\n  <div class=\"checkout-footer-note\">\n    <p><strong>Please note:</strong> Prices shown in USD. Paying from Australia? <a href=\"https://www.joinsnooze.com/offers/vYgCNgJz/checkout\" data-currency-switch=\"AUD\">View AUD pricing</a>.</p>\n    <p>All products and services are covered by our <a href=\"/terms-conditions\" target=\"_blank\">Terms & Conditions</a>.</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n",
